Evaluation Overview
Your submission will be evaluated based on several criteria. First, we will run automated tests to verify the functional requirements, such as the correct implementation of each of the four code-splitting versions, the presence of required UI elements, and the proper functioning of navigation. Automated code analysis will be used to assess code quality, project structure, and adherence to React best practices. Your docker-compose.yml setup will be checked for correctness and the ability to serve the final application. Finally, your analysis report, including the results table and strategic recommendations, will be reviewed for clarity, accuracy, and depth of understanding.